sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant K as Keywarden
  participant AD as Administrator
  participant AG as Agent
  participant H as Managed Host

  U->>K: Submit access request (shell/logs/users)
  K-->>U: Request status = pending
  AD->>K: Approve request
  K-->>AD: Grant active

  loop Poll every N seconds
    AG->>K: Fetch accounts + CA + log policy
    K-->>AG: Effective access state
  end

  AG->>H: Create/lock accounts + apply trust config
  AG->>K: Sync report + heartbeat + logs
  K-->>AD: Updated admin/audit view

  AD->>K: Revoke or let request expire
  loop Next poll
    AG->>K: Pull updated state
    K-->>AG: User removed/expired
  end
  AG->>H: Enforce revocation
